{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e3e2d6006945d2806604","chatId":"1426eaadf01d4251b9977ad6035067c6","sessionId":null,"userId":64398,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[A]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[A]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":668,"promptTokens":1491,"completionTokens":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:41:22"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008577483766375986,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e3e2d6006945d2806603","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368482610,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:41:22","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e3e2d6006945d2806603","chatId":"1426eaadf01d4251b9977ad6035067c6","sessionId":null,"userId":64398,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n星期五下午，学校的图书馆里，小杰正在专心阅读一本小说。小红和小亮坐在他旁边的桌子上，他们是小杰的同学。小红突然对小亮说：“你知道小杰每天都来这里读书吗？我觉得他有点怪怪的。”就在这时，小杰听到了他们的谈话，悄悄地关上书本，准备离开。小亮却不知道小杰听到了，继续说道：“是啊，他总是一个人坐在这里，可能是因为他比较害羞吧。”小杰感到有点尴尬，但还是礼貌地说：“嗯，我只是享受在这里安静地读书。”小红和小亮笑了笑，然后小亮问：“小杰，你现在要去踢足球吗？”\n\n[问题]\n小亮知道小杰听见他的谈话吗?\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 不知道\nB. 知道","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008577483766375986,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e3e2d6006945d2806604","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368482608,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:41:22","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"cb9ae842c31e465589dae5397fbef0bd"}